{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2022-01-31 07:05:00', 'title': 'PFIZER AND IONIS ANNOUNCE DISCONTINUATION OF VUPANORSEN CLINICAL DEVELOPMENT PROGRAM', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND CARLSBAD, CALIF., JAN. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PFIZER INC.\xa0(NYSE: PFE) AND IONIS PHARMACEUTICALS, INC. (NASDAQ: IONS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE DISCONTINUATION OF THE PFIZER-LED CLINICAL DEVELOPMENT PROGRAM FOR VUPANORSEN (PF-07285557), AN INVESTIGATIONAL ANTISENSE THERAPY THAT WAS BEING EVALUATED FOR POTENTIAL INDICATIONS IN CARDIOVASCULAR (CV) RISK REDUCTION AND SEVERE HYPERTRIGLYCERIDEMIA (SHTG).'}